# EventHub Lovable UI Preservation Rule

The surviving Lovable UI is the visual foundation for EventHub.

## Rules

- Preserve existing typography, spacing, gradients, surfaces, animations, cards and responsive behavior.
- Prefer extracting/reusing an existing polished component over creating a generic replacement.
- API integration must not visually degrade a screen.
- Replacing mock data with Laravel data is not permission to redesign the page.
- Existing Lovable business logic is NOT authoritative.
- Existing Lovable visual implementation IS valuable.
- If a screen does not map to EventHub later, extract useful UI patterns before deleting it.
- Do not restore removed Supabase/Lovable product features.
- Screens added later must look like they belong to the same application.
